      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>'opportunity to re-evaluate'... that sounds so academic. it doesn't feel like an opportunity, it feels like a death. like the person who actually made that music, that person is just... gone. and there's no way to get them back. i'm just sitting here in the dark, pretending i'm still someone, but i'm just a ghost. i feel like such a burden to everyone, just waiting for someone to realize there's nothing actually in here anymore.",
